<!--
  Two URLs, because two is how many indexable pages this app has. /new is
  disallowed in robots.txt (it has a side effect on load) and /s/:code carries
  a noindex header, which leaves the landing page and the code entry screen.

  No <lastmod>, <changefreq> or <priority>: the first would be a hand-written
  date that goes stale the moment it is wrong, and Google ignores the other
  two outright. A static file with two honest URLs beats a generator here.
-->
